---
import Container from '@/shared/ui/Container.astro';
import Icon from '@/shared/ui/Icon.astro';
import Logo from '@/shared/ui/Logo.astro';
import { publishable } from '@/shared/config/field';
import { routes } from '@/shared/config/routes';
import { fullAddress, mapQuery, site } from '@/shared/config/site';

const oab = publishable(site.lawyer.oab);
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const mapsUrl = `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${mapQuery()}`;
const credit = `Responsável: ${site.lawyer.name}, ${site.lawyer.role}${oab ? ` / OAB/BA ${oab}` : ''}. Conteúdo em conformidade com o Provimento nº 205/2021 da OAB.`;
---

<footer class="bg-ink text-blue-200/80">
  <Container class="py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <a href={routes.home} class="inline-block" aria-label={`${site.name}: página inicial`}>
          <Logo height={76} class="h-[76px] w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-200/75">
          Advocacia com escuta, clareza e responsabilidade. Atuação concentrada em Direito Bancário,
          na defesa de pessoas físicas nas relações com instituições financeiras.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={site.social.instagram}
            class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-white/35 text-blue-200 transition hover:border-white/60 hover:text-white"
            aria-label="Instagram do escritório"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <Icon name="lucide:instagram" size={18} />
          </a>
          <a
            href={site.social.instagramLawyer}
            class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-white/35 text-blue-200 transition hover:border-white/60 hover:text-white"
            aria-label="Instagram da Dra. Roberta Veloso"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <Icon name="lucide:instagram" size={18} />
          </a>
          <a
            href={site.phone.whatsapp}
            class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-white/35 text-blue-200 transition hover:border-white/60 hover:text-white"
            aria-label="WhatsApp do escritório"
            data-wa
            data-wa-location="footer"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <Icon name="lucide:message-circle" size={18} />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-sky-300">Navegação</h2>
        <nav class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3" aria-label="Navegação do rodapé">
          <a class="py-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white" href={routes.home}>
            Início
          </a>
          <a class="py-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white" href="/#escritorio">
            O escritório
          </a>
          <a class="py-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white" href="/#areas">
            Áreas de atuação
          </a>
          <a class="py-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white" href="/#duvidas">
            Dúvidas
          </a>
          <a class="py-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white" href="/#localizacao">
            Onde estamos
          </a>
          <a class="py-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white" href="/#contato">
            Contato
          </a>
          <a
            class="mt-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:text-sky-300"
            href={routes.landing}
          >
            Busca e apreensão de veículo
          </a>
          <a class="text-sm transition hover:text-white" href={routes.privacy}>
            Política de privacidade
          </a>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="py-1.5 text-left text-sm transition hover:text-white"
            data-consent-open
          >
            Preferências de cookies
          </button>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-sky-300">Contato</h2>
        <address class="mt-4 not-italic text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-200/75">
          {fullAddress()}
        </address>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <a class="py-1 transition hover:text-white" href={`tel:${site.phone.e164}`}>
            {site.phone.display}
          </a>
          <a class="py-1 transition hover:text-white" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
            {site.email}
          </a>
          <a
            class="py-1 transition hover:text-white"
            href={mapsUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Ver no Google Maps
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-200/75">
          Atendimento presencial em Salvador e online em {site.serviceArea}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 pt-8 text-xs leading-relaxed text-blue-200/60">
      <p class="max-w-4xl">
        As informações deste site têm caráter informativo e não constituem promessa de resultado nem
        substituem a análise individualizada de cada caso. Cada situação depende do contrato, do
        processo e das circunstâncias concretas.
      </p>
      <p class="max-w-4xl">{credit}</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 sm:flex-row">
        <p>
          © {year} {site.name}. Todos os direitos reservados.
        </p>
        <p>CNPJ {site.cnpj}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</footer>
